  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d2c900221e8399e3e12b5084a2c99d150623f3db.png\" alt=\"NexusLib\"></p>\n<p><strong>NexusLib 是一個庫模組，包含我的其他模組所使用的有用函數、助手和系統。</strong></p>\n<p><br>\n<br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1ca3f4e65221d988a2fc589738b83a07cbc70f4c.png\" alt=\"Features\"></p>\n<h4>- 適用於 Multiloader 項目的註冊表助手</h4>\n<h4>- 公共類</h4>\n<h4>- 實用方法</h4>\n<h4>- 輕鬆創建方塊族系</h4>\n<h4>- 為石工台創建配方樹</h4>\n<h4>- 與加載器無關的工具動作註冊表（剝皮、耕地、鋪路等）</h4>\n<h4>- 用於移除特定方塊粒子著色的註冊表</h4>\n<h4>- 通過自動禁用功能輕鬆實現與其他模組的兼容性</h4>\n<p><br>\n<br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/08d19ba412bda8a984720e07198a5d80747eb737.png\" alt=\"Credits\"></p>\n<p>代碼協助 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fyirmiri.zeus.kitchen\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Yirmiri</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fartyrian.bsky.social\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Artyrian</a>\n<br>\n<br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41d3acdede04d56f5cdaafabbfe40363f5210c2c.png\" alt=\"Other projects\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbountiful-fares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/29c3622b0b42366deba8707ec47c9be1f52b6166.png\" alt=\"Bountiful Fares\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappledog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ca7b844afe710794076d650c54fc0b16f9846da_0.webp\" alt=\"appledog!\"></a>\n<br>\n<br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/18c2068e77f264c50ff3a19d29073bc7f5909713.png\" alt=\"Contact\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fyrDsSeNkWu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/580b5f7f4f2d41ff0f6ee3e06caead00a6747e5d.png\" alt=\"Discord logo\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fhecco.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/439d1bf0de9cb55be3270cc1e1e2aa6149f9598e.png\" alt=\"Bluesky logo\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fHecco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a5b793cfc096e5677e0828de3aad077c729c8bc1.png\" alt=\"Twitter / X logo\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fhecco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa2ff27fa029d3462e365929eef8f4f9e1f69405.png\" alt=\"Kofi logo\"></a></p>\n<p>您可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Heccology/Bountiful-Fares/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上報告錯誤。</p>",
